    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Austin Lemieux",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117219731388287722176/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUjP7VY0Kdti5Q6-x-V0Nu7FEFq3U_-92uBLVf9JJ4xDPvSWIqS3Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Actually great value for the GP weekend. No issues and free coffee in the morning. Not the Ritz, but adequate for a couple nights on the cheap and simple.",
        "time": 1751497675,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Peter Hildebrandt",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102618895918365876084/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXN5ENC417WYLfhEPo5apCIGwEj9xx5ie2yeVfVi9aYTsINiYXN=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Super nice staff and very clean room. Quite and comfortable. Nice big parking yard and close to the highway.\nI wanted a room for two nights but they were full for the second night so I took just for one night.  Later they called me and ask if I still would like another night because they got and open room available. That was so kind of them. We stayed for two nights and had no issues. Thank you for your service.\nPeter H.",
        "time": 1727259880,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rebecca Abraham",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102762250629202346879/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKM1wWpJasYEJT1-0qD1auEqciH5Os4CoBoTjatFLR7B2I7AA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The motel is closer to the highway with many restaurants and shops nearby. For a motel, the rooms and washrooms are maintained clean and well, and the noise cancellation was better. However the bed lacking good cushioning, hence the sleep wasn't any comfortable. Additionally the AC is very slow to deliver the cold air, the room was hot for a long time. Some maintenance could really help the place. There was a coffee machine, but it wasn't working either when we stayed.",
        "time": 1717470365,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Skylar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106082937543469514252/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlCjDSfvhnblErFgf0qJe94yucDLtc2vSHz-_7JbZUP15aAoaDNA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "We were pleasantly surprised by this motel! We arrived a little bit later than intended and had no issues checking in.\n\nThe motel has a certain charm to it, and appeared well taken care of despite its age. The room was sparkling clean and had a very comfortable, not too soft but still plush feeling bed. The bathroom had a large counter and felt like it could have been in a more expensive accommodation. The a/c worked great and quickly cooled/dried the room out upon use.\n\nThere are some restaurants and bars within walkable distance, but you do have to walk through some parking lots to get to them.\n\nGreat value for the money, we would stay here again if we were passing through the area.",
        "time": 1660088171,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Hill",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112584208003973448304/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUXjlzils4Kg2r3tqeYqfvdFcecdsk8zKlGLOk7XAPTWGkAkNu16g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "We stayed here last minute on our drive back to Ontario. The room was so clean and the beds super comfortable. It is of course simple and dated in the decor but otherwise it had no funky odours and what we appreciated most beyond the comfy beds was how well the AC worked! When we arrived the room was 30 degrees and in 90 minutes a cool 22. My husband, kids and I slept comfortably and soundly. Quiet, comfortable and we are now refreshed for the drive ahead.",
        "time": 1630070249,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
